  "descriptionHtml": "<h3>Breezes Cumbuco Apartment for Rent</h3>\n<p>Ocean front apartment with a total of 3 bedrooms all air conditioned. (2 bedrooms and 1 suite) with closet. Cabinets in the bedrooms, double bed in the suite and single in the bedroom, blindex in the bathrooms.</p>\n<p>Large living room in L, balcony with definitive view to the ocean. 2 bathrooms, kitchen, service area. The apartment is completely furnished. 01 parking space available with the apartment. Broadband internet and cable TV.</p>\n<p>The Condominium Cumbuco Breezes has large leisure area with swimming pools, gardens, party room, artificial lake, sauna, bar, kitchen and barbecue.</p>\n<p>Adult pool with wet bar and children’s pool, security guards, intercommunication throughout condominium, infrastructure for security system with monitoring and CCTV.</p>",
